    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51700" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰθᾰρο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cleanse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.683
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sift, winnow</i>, 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτίσσειν</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
