				506
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clear</i> property from debts and encumbrances, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				97.32
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰθᾰρο-ποίησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, ib. <i><span class="en">
				151.122
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
